%!PS
% SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 EfterScript contributors
% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% oracle: colour
% Scenario: a shading pattern inside a form. The form's procedure makes
% a radial pattern under the form's own space and fills its box with
% it; the same dictionary made on the page under a translation fills a
% second square, so the page holds one shading and two pattern
% resources whose matrices differ.
/D << /PatternType 2 /Shading << /ShadingType 3 /ColorSpace /DeviceGray
   /Coords [50 50 0 50 50 50]
   /Function << /FunctionType 2 /Domain [0 1] /C0 [1] /C1 [0.1] /N 1 >> >> >> def
/F << /FormType 1 /BBox [0 0 100 100] /Matrix [1 0 0 1 100 500]
  /PaintProc { pop D matrix makepattern setpattern 0 0 100 100 rectfill } >> def
F execform
gsave
300 300 translate
D matrix makepattern setpattern
0 0 100 100 rectfill
grestore
showpage
